flowchart LR
    Dev(["Developer"]) -->|Push feature branch| Repo["GitHub Repository sdlc-new-business-application"]
    Repo -->|Pull request to main| PR["Pull Request Validation"]
    PR --> Build["Build - dotnet build and npm run build"]
    Build --> UnitTest["Unit Tests - 80 percent coverage gate"]
    UnitTest --> CodeScan["Static Analysis - CodeQL and SonarQube"]
    CodeScan --> DepScan["Dependency and Secret Scanning"]
    DepScan --> Artifact["Publish Versioned Artifact"]
    Artifact --> DeployDev["Deploy to Dev"]
    DeployDev --> IntTest["Integration and API Tests"]
    IntTest --> DeployQA["Deploy to QA"]
    DeployQA --> E2E["End-to-End and Performance Tests"]
    E2E --> Approval{"Manual Release Approval"}
    Approval -->|Approved| DeployProd["Deploy to Production - Blue Green Slot Swap"]
    Approval -->|Rejected| Repo
    DeployProd --> Smoke["Production Smoke Tests"]
    Smoke -->|Pass| Monitor["Monitor - Application Insights"]
    Smoke -->|Fail| Rollback["Automatic Slot Rollback"]
    Rollback --> Monitor